    "board": "be going to 一般疑问：Be + 主语 + going to + 原形？\nwill 一般疑问：Will + 主语 + 原形？\n例：Is she going to dance? — Yes, she is.\nWill you help me? — Yes, I will.\n按实际回答者选择人称：Are you…? 问你一人时答 I am/I'm not。\nWhat问做什么，Where问地点，When问时间，Who问谁，How问方式。",
