    "board": "在本课肯定持续句里，表示一次完成的buy/borrow/leave等不能直接表达持续时长，换为延续状态。\nbuy→have，borrow→keep，die→be dead，leave→be away from，join→be in，come/arrive→be here，begin→be on。\n例：I have had this bike for two years.\n进阶：be open/closed/asleep/awake/married；have a cold；be over/out/back。\n例外：否定可说I haven't bought a coat for two years；肯定完成或次数可说I have bought a bike / borrowed it twice。",
